  "description": "The licence panel, without a view. A ready ViewModel over OutWit.Common.Licensing — mode, severity, expiry, grants, installed documents, install, uninstall and request export, with every enablement rule already computed — plus the gateway abstraction that lets the same panel serve an in-process desktop app and a remote admin screen. No UI framework: not Avalonia, not WPF, not Blazor. Bring your own view.",
